  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Incident Forensics Lab",
    "overview": "OpsPilot AI uses warm ivory paper, deep ink, editorial headings and compact operational controls. It feels like an organized investigation dossier: calm, exact and ready for inspection. Evidence IDs, source labels and measured values carry the detail; brand expression stays concentrated in the convergence mark and serif headings.\n\nThe world is evidence-first. Quiet rules and tonal paper layers organize dense information without making every item a card. Context, reports and audit detail can expand when needed. The guide favors reading; operational surfaces favor finding a case, inspecting records and making a decision. These are expressions of one visual system, not separate identities.",
